"Translation notes from \`María López\` for **es** (Español), 3 notes on 2 pages.
Submitted with translate.beekeeperstudio.io.

### 1. \`/pricing/\` · \`p, under "Pricing"\` · generated
English: \`Pay once, use the paid features forever.\`  
Now: \`Paga una vez, usa las funciones de pago para siempre.\`  
New: \`Paga una sola vez y usa las funciones de pago para siempre.\`  
Comment: \`"una sola vez" reads more naturally.\`

### 2. \`footer\` (every page) · common
English: \`Blog\`  
Now: \`Blog\`  
New: \`Blog técnico\`  
This text is in the site footer: the change applies on every page.

### 3. \`/pricing/\` · \`p, under "Pricing"\` · explicit
English: \`Read <a href="/docs">the docs</a>\`  
Now: \`Lee <a href="/docs">la documentación</a>\`  
New: \`Consulta <a href="/docs">los documentos</a>\`  
Lint warnings: \`glossary: "Docs" is usually "Documentación"\`  
Heads up: the current translation has changed since this note was written, it is now \`otra\`.  
**Stale:** this English text is no longer on the page. Skip this note.

